CindersOfLament.Calamitas:
	'''
	'My brothers perished in Azafure. I found their bodies near the center of the city, after they left for an expedition.
	Before my power was what it is now, they were always alongside me and didn't allow anyone to harm me.
	It may have been a problem sometimes, but they were surprisingly obedient.
	And even after all that's happened, and even in death, they still look out for me. Isn't that sweet of them?'
	'''

