Metastasis.Calamitas:
	'''
	'When I joined Yharim's ranks, the Devourer was one of the first to greet me. He seemed kind at first, but that mask did not last long.
	He was arrogant, disrespectful and shady. If you hadn't killed him, I would've.
	I made my Sepulcher as a mockery of his arrogance, but it seems the insult fell flat. You can add "slime-brained" to his list of fabricated titles.'
	'''

